# Testing rules

See `packages/core/standards/testing.md`.

Highlights:
- Name tests by behavior, not implementation.
- One reason to fail per test.
- Mock at boundaries; fakes over mocks for repositories.
- Every bug fix gets a regression test.
- Flakes are bugs — fix or quarantine, never retry-until-green.
